I would bet that your suggestion about not having all four possible wind speed levels in the data could be a problem. Try something like droplevels() (http://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/base/html/droplevels.html) to reset all the possible values, or relevel() (https://stat.ethz.ch/R-manual/R-devel/library/stats/html/relevel.html) in which you can also choose the reference level to be used.

